Houston, you may know Kevin Fredericks from HBO Max’s *A Black Lady Sketch Show*.

@kevonstage brings clean, sharp jokes about family, marriage, parenting, faith, and the everyday stuff we all recognize. His new Tubi improv series, *The Airport*, pulls from life on the road. If you like a quick punchline and a real point of view, this is a good night out.

House of Blues Houston · Thursday, December 17, 2026

